Useful checklist to include with any request
- Photo ID (driver’s license or state ID or passport) – original or certified copy
- Proof of citizenship or immigration status (birth certificate, passport, form I-551/I-94, etc.)
- Name change documents (marriage certificate, court order) if applicable
- A clear statement of purpose (why you need the verification)
- Your contact info and preferred return method (secure mail, in-person pick-up, portal)

Security note to include in any written request
“For security reasons, please do not send my full SSN by unsecured email. I request verification via secure mail, secure portal, or in-person pick-up.”

Would you like me to:
- Draft a personalized email or letter for you with your specific details (I will not include the full SSN in plain text unless you instruct me and confirm a secure delivery method), or
