Quick notes before templates
- Confirm the issuing authority (usually the Social Security Administration in the U.S.). If it’s a different agency, adapt wording to name that agency.
- Don’t send your full SSN over insecure email or messaging. If you must provide the full number, do so only on secure forms, in person, or via an official secure portal.
