Template 1 — Formal mailed letter (request for replacement card or verification)
[Your full name]
[Your current address]
[City, State ZIP]
[Phone number]
[Date]

Social Security Administration
[Local SSA office address]

Re: Request for replacement Social Security card / verification of SSN

Dear Sir or Madam,

I am requesting a replacement Social Security card (or “a formal verification/letter showing my Social Security number”) for my records. My identifying information is as follows:

- Full name: [Your full name]  
- Date of birth: [MM/DD/YYYY]  
- Last four digits of SSN: [1234]  
- Current address: [Your address]

I have enclosed the required original documents to prove my identity and citizenship/immigration status (please see the enclosed list). Please advise if you need any additional information. I would appreciate instructions on the expected processing time and the method you will use to return the card/letter.

Enclosed: [list of documents, e.g., original driver’s license, original birth certificate]

Thank you for your assistance.

Sincerely,  
[Your signature]  
[Your printed name]  
[Phone number]  
[Email address — optional]

