- If asked to submit electronically, use a secure portal only — avoid sending IDs or full SSNs in plain email.
- The SSA does not charge for a replacement Social Security card; verify fee requirements for other agencies.
- Ask what proof will be returned and whether they will redact the SSN on any copies they send.

