To Whom It May Concern,

I am requesting a replacement Social Security card. My information is below:

- Full legal name (as on record): [Your full name]  
- Date of birth: [MM/DD/YYYY]  
- Last four digits of SSN: [1234] (I will provide the full SSN via secure channel or in person)  
- Place of birth: [City, State, Country]  
- Current address: [Street, City, State, ZIP]  
- Contact phone/email: [phone] / [email]  
- Any former names (if applicable): [former name(s)]

Enclosed are the completed Form SS-5 and original documents proving my identity and citizenship (or certified copies): [list documents you include, e.g., U.S. passport, state driver’s license, birth certificate]. Please let me know if you need any additional information or documentation.

Thank you for your assistance.

Sincerely,  
[Your full name]  
[Signature if mailing]  
[Date]

3) Template B — Request for SSN Verification / Release to Third Party (using SSA-89)
